The '''Plain Letter''' is provided as an objective for {{questlong|Alliance|1|Plain Letter (quest)|Plain Letter|race=HighElf|class=warrior}}.

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
Anger can become your most powerful weapon as long as you do not let it eat away at you. Despite our losses, do you not perceive that many of the others have simply accepted their despair instead of channeling their willpower to reclaim and avenge?

My blade swirls with grace and poise, akin to how the leaves dance amid autumn. So too shall yours, if you join me for a lesson or two in mastering it. Perceive your anger as a tool. Tame it so that those who perish at your hands will be awed by your craft. I will be waiting for you in the smaller building to the left of the Golden Ranger.
}}

