{{DISPLAYTITLE:Perfumed Letter #1}}
'''Perfumed Letter #1''' is acquired by speaking with [[Gertrud Selind]] in [[Amberwood Keep]] in [[Northwind]].

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
Dearest adventurer, I hope you find my little game in good faith. Our fine Lady Selind is most assuredly distraught about her missing possession, but fret not, I will offer you a fair clue on where to find that which you seek.

Beneath [[Suspicious Pumpkin|the plumpest orange]] you will see something that should not be there.
}}

==Patch changes==
* {{Patch|1.18.0|note=Added.}}

[[Category:Readable items]]

{{DISPLAYTITLE:Perfumed Letter #2}}
'''Perfumed Letter #2''' is acquired by interacting with the [[Suspicious Pumpkin]] in the field of the [[Plump Pumpkin]] in [[Northwind]] while in possession of [[Perfumed Letter (1)|Perfumed Letter #1]].

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
Bravo! You've taken your first successful step in solving my riddle. I must say, seeing you rummage through that pumpkin field was amusing. Did you know that your client also likes to rummage through stuff, namely other people's affairs? Enticing, isn't it? Nevertheless, a new clue for my aspiring treasure hunter.

A lonely home caught in icy breezes, [[Half-Buried Container|a hollow chest of freezing iron]].
}}

==Patch changes==
* {{Patch|1.18.0|note=Added.}}

[[Category:Readable items]]

{{DISPLAYTITLE:Perfumed Letter #3}}
'''Perfumed Letter #3''' is acquired by interacting with the [[Half-Buried Container]] in [[Northwind]] while in possession of [[Perfumed Letter (2)|Perfumed Letter #2]].

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
Quite chilly up here, don't you think? No worries, dearest friend, I am properly coated against any uncomfortable cold. Speaking of uncomfortable: Lady Selind is awfully cold herself. You can't blame her can you? Her nobleness is just too divine for the common man to understand. If only she could do something about it! Enough of her, back to you and my fascinating game. This one is a bit more tricky, but nothing is too hard for you, is it?

[[Weird Barrel|A vacant lookout]] over the cerulean depths.
}}

==Patch changes==
* {{Patch|1.18.0|note=Added.}}

[[Category:Readable items]]

{{DISPLAYTITLE:Perfumed Letter #4}}
'''Perfumed Letter #4''' is acquired by interacting with the [[Weird Barrel]] in [[Northwind]] while in possession of [[Perfumed Letter (3)|Perfumed Letter #3]].

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
A lovely view, wouldn't you agree? I am sure Lady Selind would concur. If she had any sense of beauty in her heart. But alas, a foul person such as herself wouldn't comprehend it if it was right in front of her. She will soon enough comprehend how fragile her life truly is. Forgive me, don't panic. I wouldn't dare hurt anyone, it would simply be too ugly. We're here for a fun game after all, and almost at the end! I had such tremendous fun watching you wander around Northwind. I should definitely do this again very soon. Till then, best of luck on your ventures, dearest friend. Here is the final clue.

Under [[Dragon Vault|the dragon's claws]] golden luck awaits. - Phantom Thief C.
}}

